{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object in view, move to it and take it. Otherwise, scan for objects.If object in reach, check its properties and perform specific task.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveTowardsObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ScanForObjects    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInView    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInReach    />",
